Homepage: https://github.com/YellowWhiteBlackCat/TaskForest
Description: Shared data assets for the TaskForest frontends
 TaskForest ships four independent frontend products (TaskForest-G,
 TaskForest-I, TaskForest-T, and TaskForest-B) over one product identity.
 This data-only package owns the assets those products share — the hicolor
 application icon ladder — so exactly one package owns each shared path
 instead of every frontend installing its own byte-identical copy. The
 per-frontend executables, desktop entries, and AppStream metadata remain in
 their own packages.
 .
 It installs no executable, helper, or privileged asset.
